Hash: FU7FqNXE, Date: 11/03/2026, Unit system: MM_TON_S_C
no-ports_attic.pmx
Multi-zone Acoustics of an attic ROOM:
- 2 x speakers sealed, NO Helmholtz, ports blocked.
- All walls and furniture as rigid.
a) Use damping from measured SPL.
b) Use constant VELO input for transfer function vs REW measured.
c) The spk VELOs only on outside, since speakers sealed with no-ports.
d) del_Freq=5Hz to catch peaks vs measured.
e) mic box with 4 surfaces for poer calcs.
